^warning: ignoring
static assertion failed
--
typecheck_compound_body now leaves the implicit default constructor
undeclared when a base or a member without a default member initializer has
no usable default constructor.  Fails on bin53 too; with a using-declaration
inheriting B's constructors (cpp11_inheriting_constructors_keep_implicit_
default_constructor's fix) it surfaced as a regression.  g++ 13 and clang++
18 accept this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
